request.description:
**Endpoint**: POST /api/orders
**Purpose**: Write-heavy operation with transaction management
**Expected Performance**: 50-150ms (includes DB writes, inventory updates)
**Cache Impact**: Evicts order cache entries

**Test Scenarios**:
- Single item orders
- Multi-item orders (2-5 items)
- Large orders (10+ items)
- Vary quantities (1-10)

**Request Variations**:
```json
// Minimal order
{
  "userId": "{{user_id}}",
  "items": [
    {"productId": "{{product_id_1}}", "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

// Order with notes
{
  "userId": "{{user_id}}",
  "customerNotes": "Gift wrap requested",
  "items": [
    {"productId": "{{product_id_1}}", "quantity": 3}
  ]
}
```
